{
  "$introduce": "第一章河城荷取段：ch1_nitori 来访与实力证明、ch1_nitori_boss 搓脚Boss战结算",
  "theme": "skyfootspa:kawashiro_nitori1",
  "isPause": false,
  "dialogues": {
    "ch1_nitori": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "喂喂，小兄弟。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你这家足浴店感觉生意挺红火的啊。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你是？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": ""
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "PAN_DOWN"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我是河童荷城河取。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这话听起来怎么这么绕，哪来的这么多河？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这不重要，重要的是你的店现在相当有名哦。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "既然你是河童，那就说明你是妖怪吧，这家店应该是面向人间之里的人类居民开的，为什么妖怪会知道。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "可不要小瞧了幻想乡的消息流通，人类之间产生的新奇事物，过不了多久就会传到妖怪们耳中。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "其实你的店里已经有妖怪客人了，幻想乡的大部分妖怪长得和人类本就差不多，如果伪装一下就更难区分了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以你也是来体验服务的吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_2",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "可以说是但也不完全是。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "幻想乡最先进的技术是仅由我们河童掌握的。虽然幻想乡整体的科技并不发达，但我们河童的技术不比外界差。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而我们平时会和人类做生意，这次也是同样的目的。你的足浴店如果要为顾客提供优质服务的话，肯定需要不少材料供应吧。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我们的机器可以帮你实现这一点。如果你现在手头比较紧的话我们还可以给你提供免费试用和首次购买优惠。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "但前提是，你必须向我们证明你拥有足够的实力。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "如果在把机器卖给你之后，顾客对你的服务产生不满也会牵连到我们的产品口碑。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那我该怎么进行这个实力证明？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_1",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这个简单，你给我洗个脚，让我切身体会一下你的手艺就行。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "事先说明，我会以相当严谨的态度来体验，可没有普通顾客那么好对付。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过我也给你一些准备时间，你拿着这个，准备好之后就用它右击 方块通知我来。"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "感谢",
            "click": {
              "type": "command",
              "value": "give @s marguerite:boss_seal_nitori"
            }
          }
        ],
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "ch1_nitori_boss": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "小兄弟你的手艺确实不错嘛。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_think_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "即使是我这样天天泡在水里的河童也没有洗过这么舒服的脚。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_2",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这样一来我们也能放心地跟你合作了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "hchq_1",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "nitori_name"
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "好哦",
            "click": {
              "type": "command",
              "value": "auratip_openshop"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
